      "value": "Use the provided start image as the first frame. The person ALREADY stands under the umbrella on the neon street, eyes on a point just past the camera. The live-action image morphs into hand-drawn 2D anime cel animation in the modern Japanese television idiom: clean ink contours appear around everything, the shading flattens into two-tone cels, the rain becomes drawn white streaks, the neon becomes bright painted glows, and the person turns into an anime character with the same face, hair and clothes, large expressive eyes, hair moving in the wind, until by the last second the whole shot is a moving anime frame. The camera pushes in slowly. Sound: soft rain, a gentle rising synth pad, a distant city hum. Photorealistic, cinematic visual effects, hand-drawn 2D anime cel animation, sharp detail, stable picture."
